  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Refuge for abused women in Tigray, Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">During the armed conflict in our region many women have become the victims of serious violence, taking their dignity and scarring them for life. They ran, hurting bodies, crushed minds, and now little clothing, food, help and dispersed families. Slowly they come out of hiding and start looking for help. The hospital treats immediate injuries, and we admit the women, who are in need of in-depth-psychological rehabilitation, into our refuge.</narrative>
  </description>
